        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Constructivism: Wendt's Social Theory of IR",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "AGAINST BOTH REALISM AND LIBERALISM:\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  REALISM AND LIBERALISM SHARE:                          │\n  │  • States have fixed interests (security/power OR       │\n  │    prosperity/peace)                                    │\n  │  • Anarchy has a given structure                        │\n  │  • Material factors (capabilities, economic power)      │\n  │    are primary                                          │\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-CONSTRUCTIVISM.md#004",
      "path": [
        "03-CONSTRUCTIVISM.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:international-relations:03-constructivism, git-history:international-relations:03-constructivism]",
