        "title": "Constructivism: Wendt's Social Theory of IR",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXAMPLE:\n  500 British nuclear weapons vs. 5 North Korean ones.\n  Which is more threatening to the US?\n  Material: NK has fewer.\n  Constructivist: NK is an adversary; UK is an ally.\n  The interpretation of the material fact requires\n  understanding the social relationship.\n  (Wendt's own example)\n```"
